%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 28}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Customer wants to call the CSP about their ticket]) --> Tap[Taps Call CTA in Customer App<br/>Dialer opens with Wiom IVR Masked number]
    Tap --> Dial[Customer dials<br/>CSP's phone rings showing the masked number]
    Dial --> Pick{CSP picks up?}
    Pick -->|Yes| Connect[Both parties talk · Call recorded]
    Pick -->|No| Missed[Customer hears 'call not picked'<br/>CSP gets missed-call alert on CSP App]
    Missed --> Next[CSP dials back · Continues as UC 05 or UC 06]

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class Start start
    class Connect good
    class Missed,Next neutral
